{% comment %}
  Store dev fixture for the blog page, opened with {blog.url}?view=figma (ES1-T510, TE-20 AC15;
  ES1-T507 #2). Same blocks as templates/blog.liquid; the only difference is the Figma copy
  passed as block parameters (docs/ui-spec/blog.md §2 settings table: eyebrow
  "From the Efitco blog", Figma 1:1024).

  The copy lives here, not in the schema default or locales: a fresh install keeps the eyebrow
  empty and hidden (ADR 0011 §3, ES1-T308 #1). The value is merchant content in a test template,
  like the literals in templates/index.te12.liquid, so it is not a locale string.

  Test template (ADR 0011 §6): kept for e2e, excluded from the release package.
  Remove this file before a real store release.
{% endcomment %}
{% block 'container', id: 'blog-main' %}
  {% block 'blog-articles', eyebrow: 'From the Efitco blog' %}{% endblock %}
{% endblock %}
